  "description": "These peanut butter cookies bake up soft and chewy. Milk chocolate chips mimic the flavor of a classic peanut butter cup. If you're dairy-free or don't like the taste of milk chocolate, simply replace the milk chocolate with dark or dairy-free chocolate chips.",
  "notes": "Optional substitutions: smooth peanut butter → creamy peanut butter\n\nNotes: If you're dairy-free or don't like the taste of milk chocolate, simply replace the milk chocolate chips with dark or dairy-free chocolate chips.",
